# Audit Reflog — Scheduled Job

Weekly check for unintended `reset --hard` / `reset to origin/main`. Alerts via macOS notification.

Run: `bash unified-trading-pm/scripts/repo-management/run-audit-reflog-with-alert.sh`
Start job: `bash .../launchd/install-audit-reflog.sh` then `launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.unified-trading.audit-reflog.plist`
Cancel: `launchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.unified-trading.audit-reflog.plist`
Full doc: `unified-trading-pm/docs/audit-reflog-scheduled-job.md`
